# Hermes Instructions - TeacherBOY

## Deployment

**CRITICAL: GitHub Actions is blocked by billing issue on TeacherEvan org/account.**

All deployments to Hugging Face Spaces MUST be done via direct git push:

```bash
# Add HF remote (one-time setup)
git remote add hf https://EvilEvan:${HF_TOKEN}@huggingface.co/spaces/EvilEvan/TeacherBOY

# Deploy to HF Space (run after every change to src/, tests/, Dockerfile, requirements.txt)
git push hf HEAD:main --force
```

**Do NOT rely on GitHub Actions workflows** (ci.yml, huggingface_sync.yml) - they fail with "account is locked due to a billing issue".

## Testing

```bash
# Run all tests locally
pytest tests/ -v --tb=short
```

